{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"インタビュー中にカラスを引き寄せてしまった女、能條愛未 ２０歳です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新成人の皆さん、おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私も立派な新成人となることができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、乃木神社での成人式式典。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"華の94年組ファンの皆さんたくさん集まってくださいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/13/5119618/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなそれぞれ好きな色の着物をきてるの。\nそれぞれのらしさが出ててなかなか良いバランス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは緑にしました！\n頭には赤の椿！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/13/5119618/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/13/5119618/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななせ。手"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/13/5119618/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな、らり、あみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/13/5119618/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあみ色気づいてるでしょ、\nそしたらね、さゆにゃんに「あみのくせに！」って怒られた❤️笑\nみんなかーわい❤️❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部は観れてないのですが、\nおは4、PON！、 めざましテレビ\nなどなど\n各局で私のコメントがたくさん使われていてびっくり！いや、有難いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"叩かれること覚悟で言ってしまいました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「能年玲奈さんの次は、能條愛未だ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんおっしゃるとおり、「能」しかあっておりません。笑\n透明感も、なにも、かも、叶うところはありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが女優を目指してるという上では憧れる存在でございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元の成人式にも参加しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木神社のときとは打って変わって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水色の振袖に\nピンクの髪飾り。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/13/5119618/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって2回も違う色の振袖を着られるのは嬉しいね〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/13/5119618/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マザーテレサ こと 母と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母には本当に感謝です\nこんなワガママ娘を立派な新成人になるまで育ててくれて。\nこれからもよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く親孝行がしたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/13/5119618/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元の友達と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに地元の友達に会ったけど\nみんなキャラが濃くなってて面白かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみが静かに見えるくらい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２０歳の能條愛未も\nよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/01/13/5119618/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニタニタ"}],"source":"archive"}